  "reason": "The only completed run is a single-profile RNA PCA baseline, so there is no evidence yet about whether image features are useful or how they compare to RNA. config_010 tests image-only performance with a simple single-profile ResNet50 baseline, keeping profile setting minimal and avoiding fusion/aggregation changes. This is the best next experiment because it reduces uncertainty about the modality choice before investing in multimodal fusion or more complex profile settings, and it provides a direct baseline for later multimodal ResNet50 comparisons."
